# TapTech Business Cards

Digital business card system built on Google Apps Script + Google Sheets.

## Files
- Code.gs — server logic (routes, sheet reads/writes, photo upload)
- Card.html — the public-facing card page
- Admin.html — the private admin panel (locked to one Google account)

## Key IDs (do not lose these)
- Sheet: "Business Cards Database" — 1pqExON858uEvvfpLqHUaxPet0tRMlQMd3bGzkCvVrlY
- Photos folder: "BC pictures" — 14qY5AnT476JjrCdJ8h2GB4yZTSAW7ln-
- Admin email: medward.studiodev@gmail.com

## To deploy
1. Go to script.google.com, open the project
2. Paste Code.gs, Card.html, Admin.html in
3. Deploy → Manage deployments → New version → Deploy

